<title>UK: SBC unit sets SFR bond convertible into SMI index.</title>
<headline>SBC unit sets SFR bond convertible into SMI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC (Jersey branch) has launched a 100 million Swiss franc bond convertible into SMI indices, lead manager SBC Warburg said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Each 10,000 franc note will be convertible into around 2.1 indices. Final pricing at a 23.3 percent premium will be set later today.  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     1.50	MATURITY    20.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  100.875   PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISITNG    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
